abstract: >-
  Comprehensive DevSecOps framework providing battle-tested principles, reference architectures, security controls, and implementation guidelines for integrating security seamlessly into modern software delivery pipelines across cloud-native and enterprise environments. Defines an 8-phase DevSecOps lifecycle aligned with NIST SSDF (SP 800-218) and DoD DevSecOps Fundamentals v2.5.
